calibration level(s) from the LLOQ upwards (minimum 3)\",\"\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve; not exported (no study sample above the LLOQ)\",\"Batch curve; not exported (no study sample above the LLOQ)\",\"Batch curve; not exported (no study sample above the LLOQ)\"],[\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Not quantified: No calibration level above the LLOQ signal\",\"Batch curve\",\"\",\"Batch curve\",\"Not quantified: No calibration level above the LLOQ signal\",\"Batch curve; not exported (no study sample above the LLOQ)\",\"Batch curve; not exported (no study sample above the LLOQ)\",\"\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\",\"Batch curve\"],[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"Batch 2: Full calibration range used (No sample or QC at or above the LLOQ)\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"Batch 1: Full calibration range used (No sample or QC at or above the LLOQ)\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"Batch 1: Full calibration range used (No sample or QC at or above the LLOQ); Batch 2: Full calibration range used (No sample or QC at or above the LLOQ)\"]],\"container\":\"<table class=\\\"display\\\">\\n  <thead>\\n    <tr>\\n      <th>Feature<\\/th>\\n      <th>Alignment ID<\\/th>\\n      <th>Type<\\/th>\\n      <th>RT [min]<\\/th>\\n      <th>m/z<\\/th>\\n      <th>Status<\\/th>\\n      <th>Failed IS check<\\/th>\\n      <th>Normalized by<\\/th>\\n      <th>Blank filter<\\/th>\\n      <th>QC RSD% filter<\\/th>\\n      <th>Calibration, batch 1<\\/th>\\n      <th>Calibration, batch 2<\\/th>\\n      <th>Calibration, batch 3<\\/th>\\n      <th>Notes<\\/th>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n  <\\/thead>\\n<\\/table>\",\"options\":{\"dom\":\"t\",\"paging\":false,\"scrollX\":true,\"scrollY\":\"380px\",\"scrollCollapse\":true,\"columnDefs\":[{\"className\":\"dt-center\",\"targets\":\"_all\"},{\"name\":\"Feature\",\"targets\":0},{\"name\":\"Alignment ID\",\"targets\":1},{\"name\":\"Type\",\"targets\":2},{\"name\":\"RT [min]\",\"targets\":3},{\"name\":\"m/z\",\"targets\":4},{\"name\":\"Status\",\"targets\":5},{\"name\":\"Failed IS check\",\"targets\":6},{\"name\":\"Normalized by\",\"targets\":7},{\"name\":\"Blank filter\",\"targets\":8},{\"name\":\"QC RSD% filter\",\"targets\":9},{\"name\":\"Calibration, batch 1\",\"targets\":10},{\"name\":\"Calibration, batch 2\",\"targets\":11},{\"name\":\"Calibration, batch 3\",\"targets\":12},{\"name\":\"Notes\",\"targets\":13}],\"order\":[],\"autoWidth\":false,\"orderClasses\":false}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n**How to read it**\n\n- **One row per feature** of the input file, also those removed on the way, with its **Status**:\n  where it ended (e.g. *Quantified*, *Kept*, *Removed (blank filter)*).\n- **A column per step**, in the order of the processing: what the step did with the feature\n  (*Passed*, *Removed* and why, *Not applied*). Empty: the step does not concern the feature, or\n  it was removed before.\n- **Calibration, batch N**: the curve used in each batch, its own or the global one, or why the\n  compound was not quantified there.\n- The sheet **Sample history** does the same for the samples (outliers, vIS correction, replaced\n  IS zeros, the blank subtracted, the calibration of their batch), and **Events** lists every\n  logged event, with its kind: *removed*, *fallback*, *changed* (a value replaced) or *note*.\n\n::: {.callout-tip}\n## Reuse the processing\nSave the settings with **Download parameters** on page 1 or **Download parameters (.yml)** on page 5\n(also with the export options). Loading the file later, in the app or with `run_quanta.R` on the\ncommand line, processes new data the same way.\n:::\n",
